# Version Catalog (libs.versions.toml)

When editing this file:

1. **All dependency and plugin versions** for the project are centralized here. Add or update the version entry here; reference it from `build.gradle.kts` via the version catalog (e.g. `libs.kotlin.multiplatform`).

2. Do not duplicate version numbers in `build.gradle.kts`; use the catalog alias so upgrades happen in one place.

3. After changing versions, run the relevant build (e.g. `./gradlew :composeApp:compileKotlinJvm` or `assembleDebug`) to confirm nothing breaks.
